DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}So wenige Fische in den Aquarien?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das ist schon ein bisschen...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Na, du weißt schon, oder nicht?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Qui puoi ammirare{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} tutti i pesci e
le creature acquatiche della nostra
città. {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Mitico, no?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Questo museo ha fatto un ottimo
lavoro!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Del resto, la classe non è...
acqua! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Che storia!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Questo acquario
è praticamente vuoto!
Non me lo aspettavo proprio!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Per stavolta, questo museo ha fatto
un...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} buco nell'acqua.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah ça ça!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Şimdilik burada neredeyse hiç
balık ya da deniz canlısı yok.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Biraz utandırıcı.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Si tuviera que elegir ser un pez,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
creo que me quedaría con el atún,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
o quizá el salmón.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Oye!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Que esto es hipotético!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡No me mires con gula!
